{
 "id": "IqDoublesC01",
 "slug": "iq-doubles/c01",
 "chapter": "The morning it started",
 "topic": "What if your IQ doubled every day?",
 "script": [
  {
   "beat": "p1",
   "text": "Seven AM. Your alarm goes off. And for the first time in your life, you're not tired. You're... awake. Really awake."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p2",
   "text": "At breakfast, your little sister Ellie is crying over her math homework. You glance at it. Done. All twenty questions. In your head. Before your toast pops up."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p3",
   "text": "Mom's old puzzle cube is on the shelf. Nobody in this house has ever solved it. You pick it up. Click, click, click. Eleven seconds."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p4",
   "text": "On the bus, you open a history book you were supposed to read last month. You turn the pages like you're flicking through a comic. You remember every word."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p5",
   "text": "Then you do the math on yourself. Something happened to your brain overnight. It got twice as good. And tomorrow morning, it's going to happen again."
  },
  {
   "beat": "p6",
   "text": "What if your IQ doubled, every single day?"
  }
 ],
